    "title": "Nucor Steel West Virginia opens applications for 2027 Technical Academy | WV News | wvnews.com",
    "text": "APPLE GROVE, W.Va. — Nucor Steel West Virginia is accepting applications for its 2027 Nucor Technical Academy class, offering high school graduates and GED recipients an opportunity to pursue careers in electrical maintenance through a combination of college coursework, paid training and hands-on experience.\nThe 27-month program is designed to prepare participants for electrical maintenance careers at Nucor by combining classroom instruction with structured, hands-on assignments alongside experienced maintenance employees.",
